, "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303476_2630050647337413_6393422574423242231_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xbbDGc1D4M4Q7kNvwG59UQ1&_nc_oc=AdqvrFD1lzq23JrOf--mRTrzfjWsJwMzp6TPu8LzgfZ2D4FLBxN1CfeMuWPTpax_kW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_YgQquG_vlSa7fsJVeFyAleIMCjL3aB6sDYt9IHU2i6A&oe=6A22D202"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "667704452803486", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298254_667704456136819_1022445440440322231_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E2p_ABRj7CAQ7kNvwH3NkNt&_nc_oc=AdoH0AI5NTYn8hyhtt33aYNxPAdzZhwJrl1Df8Hf161IkHBcu6vDiXeH8oY1nJ2gi7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9VJ9O-PekFAmCDJAAq1kpGbY3MlveSyANNesXVYypicQ&oe=6A22CDFC"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2212265415867784", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_2212265419201117_5311145768653546432_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EzVJ68z7N08Q7kNvwEDhUdG&_nc_oc=AdqlOuA9UeVJsZB7P2ujaMW5xTPF40zrwx88WEfkkSWF8Gr9XYNqi5Kqgl1c2t5FvOg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-naVhZ3JJpC8WJ2p89f8tFJWzfvNNaSYjeUsc3ViZ8Mw&oe=6A22CEC1"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "687428147377431", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312039_687428150710764_498678448022996487_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ppflu12M3D8Q7kNvwEtwKwC&_nc_oc=Adpp8sU2xc7ExbPw_VUOCgxK9d04dCrqJNgK3VPGixvq7ISAh9Pl5zk-pccB0Yflv7U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_jjXYsxJrPyW6sPjtYOo4ZjR3Y-gZfGQgEc8aCLp_M_A&oe=6A22FA66"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "App Lab Banner- Intulect  (1).png", "id": "1242180674168726", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307413_1242180677502059_8955428851085587533_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JeQ0JX15hL0Q7kNvwG-Ga8t&_nc_oc=AdpG60BeGqlLKfUB7Hvl5K173T3wEMxv7Tw4nbj_W2CN2oShizXR139IusQNduuxtik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-KZ3R3whTumO-b6JdTXrFnKd9RIv-NX7KBBz__uXrL1w&oe=6A22D71A"}, "display_name": "Intulect", "keywords": ["Nursing", "Education", "Simulation", "Healthcare", "Medical"], "long_description": "Intulect\u2019s AI-powered VR Nursing Simulations provide scalable, immersive, and competency-based training for nursing students and hospital systems. Our platform leverages AI to moderate and assess clinical simulations, eliminating the need for live facilitators while ensuring realistic, high-quality training experiences.\n\nKey Features:\n- AI-Moderated Simulations \u2013 Nursing students engage with AI-driven patients and scenarios, allowing for self-guided, competency-based learning without requiring an instructor to be present.\n-Real-Time Performance Tracking \u2013 Automated grading and analytics provide educators with detailed insights into student decision-making and competency development.\n-Scalable Clinical Practice \u2013 Institutions can expand simulation access without increasing costs, making hands-on training more accessible to students.\n-High-Fidelity Patient Interactions \u2013 AI-driven patients respond dynamically, improving critical thinking, prioritization, and communication skills.\n-Seamless Integration \u2013 Designed to fit into nursing curricula, our simulations enhance theoretical learning, lab practice, and clinical training.\nWith Intulect, nursing programs and hospital systems can provide flexible, cost-effective, and data-driven training solutions, better preparing nurses for real-world challenges.", "short_description": "Where Training Becomes Instinct. Intulect is an AI-Facilitated Nursing Simulation Platform to improve clinical preparedness for all level of learners in healthcare. "}]}, "developer_name": "Intulect", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://intulect.com/policies/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_u